OL,3,GNEWSAFlats to be demolished over fire
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo blocks of flats on the outskirts of
OL,7,Fa city centre are to be flattened over
OL,8,Fconcerns about the safety of the
OL,9,Fcladding that covers them.
OL,11,FThe buildings, on Hopwood Street, off
OL,12,FRingway, Preston, are empty and the
OL,13,Fdozens of social housing tenants who
OL,14,Foccupied them have been rehomed.
OL,16,FCommunity Gateway Association (CGA),
OL,17,Fthe landlord for the four-storey
OL,18,Fproperties ` which each house 15 flats
OL,19,F` told Preston City Council it planned
OL,20,Fto pull them down.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
