OL,3,GNEWSAFlats to be demolished over fire
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are clad at the front and back
OL,7,Fwith High Pressure Laminate (HPL), the
OL,8,Ftype of cladding present at the site of
OL,9,Fthe Lackanal House blaze in Southwark
OL,10,Fin 2009 ` which killed six people.
